<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>UEFI on 我的博客</title><link>https://wangqian306.github.io/tags/uefi/</link><description>Recent content in UEFI on 我的博客</description><generator>Hugo -- gohugo.io</generator><language>zh-cn</language><lastBuildDate>Thu, 13 Sep 2018 18:36:55 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://wangqian306.github.io/tags/uefi/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>对AMI BIOS固件解锁隐藏选项（解锁CSM）</title><link>https://wangqian306.github.io/p/%E5%AF%B9ami-bios%E5%9B%BA%E4%BB%B6%E8%A7%A3%E9%94%81%E9%9A%90%E8%97%8F%E9%80%89%E9%A1%B9%E8%A7%A3%E9%94%81csm/</link><pubDate>Thu, 13 Sep 2018 18:36:55 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://wangqian306.github.io/p/%E5%AF%B9ami-bios%E5%9B%BA%E4%BB%B6%E8%A7%A3%E9%94%81%E9%9A%90%E8%97%8F%E9%80%89%E9%A1%B9%E8%A7%A3%E9%94%81csm/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;本文接上篇&lt;a class="link" href="http://blog.mxslly.com/archives/63.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&#10; &gt;神舟战神z7-pro强刷BIOS教程(AMI BIOS)&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;替换开机图片完毕后（或者替换失败也没关系，不影响使用），我们继续修改BIOS，解锁BIOS里面的高级选项，我这里要解锁CSM选项&#10;使得BIOS能支持安装Windows7&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;先放上成果：[修改版BIOS固件][5]支持CSM模式蓝天logo&#10;链接：[https://pan.baidu.com/s/1L42A-BEJVttqrxHEUuuUkA][6]&#10;密码：dsyk&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;h2 id="实测bios关闭uefi磁盘分区表格式mbr能完美安装win7"&gt;实测BIOS关闭UEFI，磁盘分区表格式MBR，能完美安装Win7&#10;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h2 id="实测bios打开uefi磁盘分区表格式gptbios打开csm模式也能完美安装win7"&gt;实测BIOS打开UEFI，磁盘分区表格式GPT，BIOS打开CSM模式，也能完美安装Win7&#10;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;win7对UEFI启动的支持不完全，在UEFI环境下开机启动的过程中，还是会用传统方式INT 10中断调用显卡驱动，如果BIOS是完全的UEFI环境，那就会开机卡四叶草，如果BIOS有CSM(Compatibility Support Module兼容性支持模块)并打开，那么就会接受win7 INT10调用显卡驱动的方式，从而正常启动。&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;h2 id="1下载修改工具amibcp-v502"&gt;1.下载修改工具[amibcp v5.02]&#10;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;链接: &lt;a class="link" href="https://pan.baidu.com/s/1HBAX2bpqmjQY2EdqNFmYOA" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&#10; &gt;https://pan.baidu.com/s/1HBAX2bpqmjQY2EdqNFmYOA&lt;/a&gt;&#10;密码: 22cp&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="AMIBCPICON.JPG" class="gallery-image" data-flex-basis="204px" data-flex-grow="85" height="149" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 30px), (max-width: 1023px) 700px, (max-width: 1279px) 950px, 1232px" src="https://wangqian306.github.io/p/%E5%AF%B9ami-bios%E5%9B%BA%E4%BB%B6%E8%A7%A3%E9%94%81%E9%9A%90%E8%97%8F%E9%80%89%E9%A1%B9%E8%A7%A3%E9%94%81csm/amibcp.jpg" width="127"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;h2 id="2运行amibcpexe选择file-open打开要修改的bios固件"&gt;2.运行AMIBCP.exe，选择file-&amp;gt;open打开要修改的BIOS固件&#10;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="AMIBCP打开文件.jpg" class="gallery-image" data-flex-basis="464px" data-flex-grow="193" height="381" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 30px), (max-width: 1023px) 700px, (max-width: 1279px) 950px, 1232px" src="https://wangqian306.github.io/p/%E5%AF%B9ami-bios%E5%9B%BA%E4%BB%B6%E8%A7%A3%E9%94%81%E9%9A%90%E8%97%8F%E9%80%89%E9%A1%B9%E8%A7%A3%E9%94%81csm/AMIBCP%E6%89%93%E5%BC%80%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6.jpg" width="737"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;h2 id="3界面左侧-打开根节点-打开setup节点-选中advanced节点"&gt;3.界面左侧 打开根节点-&amp;gt;打开Setup节点-&amp;gt;选中Advanced节点&#10;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;界面右侧 选中 Show Launch CSM item 选项&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="打开节点.jpg" class="gallery-image" data-flex-basis="463px" data-flex-grow="193" height="429" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 30px), (max-width: 1023px) 700px, (max-width: 1279px) 950px, 1232px" src="https://wangqian306.github.io/p/%E5%AF%B9ami-bios%E5%9B%BA%E4%BB%B6%E8%A7%A3%E9%94%81%E9%9A%90%E8%97%8F%E9%80%89%E9%A1%B9%E8%A7%A3%E9%94%81csm/%E6%89%93%E5%BC%80%E8%8A%82%E7%82%B9.jpg" srcset="https://wangqian306.github.io/p/%E5%AF%B9ami-bios%E5%9B%BA%E4%BB%B6%E8%A7%A3%E9%94%81%E9%9A%90%E8%97%8F%E9%80%89%E9%A1%B9%E8%A7%A3%E9%94%81csm/%E6%89%93%E5%BC%80%E8%8A%82%E7%82%B9_hu_3a25bb60c7f1793a.jpg 800w, https://wangqian306.github.io/p/%E5%AF%B9ami-bios%E5%9B%BA%E4%BB%B6%E8%A7%A3%E9%94%81%E9%9A%90%E8%97%8F%E9%80%89%E9%A1%B9%E8%A7%A3%E9%94%81csm/%E6%89%93%E5%BC%80%E8%8A%82%E7%82%B9.jpg 829w" width="829"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;h2 id="4双击-show-launch-csm-item-选项这一行的accessuse列将default改为user"&gt;4.双击 Show Launch CSM item 选项这一行的Access/Use列，将Default改为USER&#10;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="改为USER.jpg" class="gallery-image" data-flex-basis="463px" data-flex-grow="192" height="594" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 30px), (max-width: 1023px) 700px, (max-width: 1279px) 950px, 1232px" src="https://wangqian306.github.io/p/%E5%AF%B9ami-bios%E5%9B%BA%E4%BB%B6%E8%A7%A3%E9%94%81%E9%9A%90%E8%97%8F%E9%80%89%E9%A1%B9%E8%A7%A3%E9%94%81csm/%E6%94%B9%E4%B8%BAUSER.jpg" srcset="https://wangqian306.github.io/p/%E5%AF%B9ami-bios%E5%9B%BA%E4%BB%B6%E8%A7%A3%E9%94%81%E9%9A%90%E8%97%8F%E9%80%89%E9%A1%B9%E8%A7%A3%E9%94%81csm/%E6%94%B9%E4%B8%BAUSER_hu_2dfe0f8cca698778.jpg 800w, https://wangqian306.github.io/p/%E5%AF%B9ami-bios%E5%9B%BA%E4%BB%B6%E8%A7%A3%E9%94%81%E9%9A%90%E8%97%8F%E9%80%89%E9%A1%B9%E8%A7%A3%E9%94%81csm/%E6%94%B9%E4%B8%BAUSER.jpg 1146w" width="1146"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;还是要解释一下，Defalut是默认情况，这个时候选项不一定会出现。但是你改为USER后就一定会出现。&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;h2 id="5点击保存图标保存修改后的固件默认覆盖原文件"&gt;5.点击保存图标，保存修改后的固件（默认覆盖原文件）&#10;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="保存.jpg" class="gallery-image" data-flex-basis="696px" data-flex-grow="290" height="90" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 30px), (max-width: 1023px) 700px, (max-width: 1279px) 950px, 1232px" src="https://wangqian306.github.io/p/%E5%AF%B9ami-bios%E5%9B%BA%E4%BB%B6%E8%A7%A3%E9%94%81%E9%9A%90%E8%97%8F%E9%80%89%E9%A1%B9%E8%A7%A3%E9%94%81csm/%E4%BF%9D%E5%AD%98.jpg" width="261"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;h2 id="6使用fptw64exe强制刷入固件重启后进入bios查看效果"&gt;6.使用fptw64.exe强制刷入固件，重启后进入BIOS查看效果&#10;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="刷入修改CSM的固件.jpg" class="gallery-image" data-flex-basis="313px" data-flex-grow="130" height="384" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 30px), (max-width: 1023px) 700px, (max-width: 1279px) 950px, 1232px" src="https://wangqian306.github.io/p/%E5%AF%B9ami-bios%E5%9B%BA%E4%BB%B6%E8%A7%A3%E9%94%81%E9%9A%90%E8%97%8F%E9%80%89%E9%A1%B9%E8%A7%A3%E9%94%81csm/%E5%88%B7%E5%85%A5%E4%BF%AE%E6%94%B9CSM%E7%9A%84%E5%9B%BA%E4%BB%B6.jpg" width="502"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;h2 id="7进入主板设置"&gt;7.进入主板设置&#10;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="显示CSM开关.jpg" class="gallery-image" data-flex-basis="463px" data-flex-grow="193" height="429" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 30px), (max-width: 1023px) 700px, (max-width: 1279px) 950px, 1232px" src="https://wangqian306.github.io/p/%E5%AF%B9ami-bios%E5%9B%BA%E4%BB%B6%E8%A7%A3%E9%94%81%E9%9A%90%E8%97%8F%E9%80%89%E9%A1%B9%E8%A7%A3%E9%94%81csm/%E6%98%BE%E7%A4%BACSM%E5%BC%80%E5%85%B3.jpg" srcset="https://wangqian306.github.io/p/%E5%AF%B9ami-bios%E5%9B%BA%E4%BB%B6%E8%A7%A3%E9%94%81%E9%9A%90%E8%97%8F%E9%80%89%E9%A1%B9%E8%A7%A3%E9%94%81csm/%E6%98%BE%E7%A4%BACSM%E5%BC%80%E5%85%B3_hu_37837ea6b8d54596.jpg 800w, https://wangqian306.github.io/p/%E5%AF%B9ami-bios%E5%9B%BA%E4%BB%B6%E8%A7%A3%E9%94%81%E9%9A%90%E8%97%8F%E9%80%89%E9%A1%B9%E8%A7%A3%E9%94%81csm/%E6%98%BE%E7%A4%BACSM%E5%BC%80%E5%85%B3.jpg 829w" width="829"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;Show Launch CSM Item 选项 打开&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="打开Launch CSM选项.jpg" class="gallery-image" data-flex-basis="463px" data-flex-grow="193" height="429" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 30px), (max-width: 1023px) 700px, (max-width: 1279px) 950px, 1232px" src="https://wangqian306.github.io/p/%E5%AF%B9ami-bios%E5%9B%BA%E4%BB%B6%E8%A7%A3%E9%94%81%E9%9A%90%E8%97%8F%E9%80%89%E9%A1%B9%E8%A7%A3%E9%94%81csm/%E6%89%93%E5%BC%80LaunchCSM%E9%80%89%E9%A1%B9.jpg" srcset="https://wangqian306.github.io/p/%E5%AF%B9ami-bios%E5%9B%BA%E4%BB%B6%E8%A7%A3%E9%94%81%E9%9A%90%E8%97%8F%E9%80%89%E9%A1%B9%E8%A7%A3%E9%94%81csm/%E6%89%93%E5%BC%80LaunchCSM%E9%80%89%E9%A1%B9_hu_86d8c187c9b91b4e.jpg 800w, https://wangqian306.github.io/p/%E5%AF%B9ami-bios%E5%9B%BA%E4%BB%B6%E8%A7%A3%E9%94%81%E9%9A%90%E8%97%8F%E9%80%89%E9%A1%B9%E8%A7%A3%E9%94%81csm/%E6%89%93%E5%BC%80LaunchCSM%E9%80%89%E9%A1%B9.jpg 829w" width="829"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;CSM开关 打开&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;h2 id="最后f4保存重启现在你的bios已经支持uefi下面csm模式启动win7了"&gt;最后F4保存重启，现在你的BIOS已经支持UEFI下面CSM模式启动win7了&#10;&lt;/h2&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>